 "Rookery has no player accounts. Each visitor’s progress, ratings and game history are stored only in their own browser (IndexedDB) and never reach the server, so individual users cannot be listed, searched, suspended or inspected here. Central user administration needs a backend database with sign-in (accounts, password reset, privacy policy, moderation tools) — a separate project.": "Rookeryda o'yinchi hisoblari yo'q. Har bir tashrifchining taraqqiyoti, reytinglari va o'yinlar tarixi faqat o'z brauzerida (IndexedDB) saqlanadi va hech qachon serverga yetib bormaydi, shuning uchun alohida foydalanuvchilarni bu yerda ro'yxatlab, qidirib, to'xtatib yoki ko'rib bo'lmaydi. Markaziy foydalanuvchilarni boshqarish kirish tizimiga ega backend ma'lumotlar bazasini (hisoblar, parolni tiklash, maxfiylik siyosati, moderatsiya vositalari) talab qiladi — bu alohida loyiha.",
 "Reported content and abuse review do not apply: players cannot publish or share any content.": "Shikoyat qilingan kontent va suiiste'molni ko'rib chiqish bu yerda qo'llanmaydi: o'yinchilar hech qanday kontent e'lon qila olmaydi yoki ulasha olmaydi.",
